  "cacheVersion": "2026-05-13-gear-cards",
  "html": "<p class=\"\">Apps and payloads for the Flipper Zero and its 128×64 monochrome screen. <a href=\"/projects/flipper-generative-art\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">Flipper Generative Art</a> — real-time 1-bit generative patterns on the device — has its own page.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Dithered radial patterns generated on the Flipper Zero\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/flipper-generative-art/gallery-1.png\" alt=\"Dithered radial patterns generated on the Flipper Zero\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/flipper-generative-art/gallery-1.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/flipper-generative-art/gallery-1.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/flipper-generative-art/gallery-1.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/flipper-generative-art/gallery-1.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Dithered radial patterns generated on the Flipper Zero\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.61deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1024×512\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Dithered radial patterns generated on the Flipper Zero</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"flipper-space-calculators\">Flipper Space Calculators</h2>\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"/projects/flipper-space-calculators\" class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\">Flipper Space Calculators</a> is a set of minimalist space and physics calculators — relativistic time dilation, space-travel figuring, and friends — for back-of-the-napkin astrophysics in your pocket. The transfer solver works out delta-v and flight time from a celestial-body database keyed by semi-major axis.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"md-blockquote\">\n<p class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">It's a tool for a time / space-traveler who doesn't exist, or maybe does, and makes a tool that he would find handy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The transfer solver — delta-v, flight time, and a celestial-body database keyed by semi-major axis\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/flipper-space-calculators/code2.png\" alt=\"The transfer solver — delta-v, flight time, and a celestial-body database keyed by semi-major axis\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/flipper-space-calculators/code2.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/flipper-space-calculators/code2.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/flipper-space-calculators/code2.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/flipper-space-calculators/code2.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The transfer solver — delta-v, flight time, and a celestial-body database keyed by semi-major axis\" width=\"1400\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:-0.89deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1400×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The transfer solver — delta-v, flight time, and a celestial-body database keyed by semi-major axis</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"spectrum-synth\">Spectrum Synth</h2>\n<p class=\"\">Spectrum Synth is a WiFi spectrum analyzer for the Flipper Zero, paired with an ESP32-S2 dev board. It sweeps the 2.4GHz band and draws channel activity as real-time spectrum bars and a waterfall on the Flipper's screen.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The Flipper firmware — UART from the ESP32-S2 into real-time spectrum bars and a waterfall on the 128×64 screen\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/spectrum-synth/code.png\" alt=\"The Flipper firmware — UART from the ESP32-S2 into real-time spectrum bars and a waterfall on the 128×64 screen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/spectrum-synth/code.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/spectrum-synth/code.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/spectrum-synth/code.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/spectrum-synth/code.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The Flipper firmware — UART from the ESP32-S2 into real-time spectrum bars and a waterfall on the 128×64 screen\" width=\"1400\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1400×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The Flipper firmware — UART from the ESP32-S2 into real-time spectrum bars and a waterfall on the 128×64 screen</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"\" id=\"badusb-remote-desktop\">BadUSB Remote Desktop</h2>\n<p class=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ejfox/badusb-remote-desktop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external-link group inline-flex items-center text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400\" data-preview-url=\"https://github.com/ejfox/badusb-remote-desktop\">BadUSB Remote Desktop<svg class=\"inline-block w-4 h-4 ml-1 opacity-50 dark:opacity-75 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity align-text-bottom\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385c.6.113.82-.258.82-.577c0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04c-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729c1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236c1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998c.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605c-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93c0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22c-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176c0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23c.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405c1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405c2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23c.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176c.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22c0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92c.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22c0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286c0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12\" class=\"\"></path></svg></a> is a set of Flipper Zero BadUSB payloads that make a fresh, keyboard-less machine reachable on the LAN for remote desktop — macOS Screen Sharing (VNC), Windows RDP, or Linux VNC. Plug in the Flipper instead of digging out a spare keyboard, mouse, and monitor just to switch on remote access.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Badusb Remote Desktop — a real DuckyScript payload in a vulpes terminal\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/badusb-remote-desktop/terminal.png\" alt=\"Badusb Remote Desktop — a real DuckyScript payload in a vulpes terminal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/badusb-remote-desktop/terminal.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/badusb-remote-desktop/terminal.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/badusb-remote-desktop/terminal.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/badusb-remote-desktop/terminal.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Badusb Remote Desktop — a real DuckyScript payload in a vulpes terminal\" width=\"1583\" height=\"918\" style=\"--splay-rot:0.6deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1583×918\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-video w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Badusb Remote Desktop — a real DuckyScript payload in a vulpes terminal</figcaption>\n</figure>",
